## Third-party components

The MIT licence above covers this application's own source code. It does not
cover the model weights the app downloads at runtime, or the bundled fonts,
each of which carries its own terms.

### Bundled fonts (`public/fonts/`)

Inter and Special Elite are both licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1,
which permits bundling and redistribution.
  - Inter — https://github.com/rsms/inter
  - Special Elite — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Special+Elite

### Models downloaded at runtime

These are fetched from Hugging Face directly by the user's browser and are
never redistributed by this project, but their terms govern that use:

  - Gemma 3 / Gemma 4 (`onnx-community/gemma-*`) — Google's Gemma Terms of Use,
    which impose use restrictions and a notice-passthrough obligation:
    https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms
  - Qwen2.5 / Qwen3 / Qwen3.5 (`onnx-community/Qwen*`) — Apache-2.0 or the
    Qwen licence, per the individual model repository.
  - `Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2` — Apache-2.0.
  - `SamLowe/roberta-base-go_emotions-onnx` — MIT.

Third-party npm dependency licences are emitted to
`3rdpartylicenses.txt` in the production build output.
